1
00:00:00,065 --> 00:00:02,025
Look, question two:

2
00:00:02,193 --> 00:00:04,443
"When are roadways most slippery?"

3
00:00:04,612 --> 00:00:06,992
(Sheldon:)There are three answers,
none of which are correct.

4
00:00:07,156 --> 00:00:11,206
The correct answer is, "When covered by
liquid sufficient to reduce the coefficient...

5
00:00:11,368 --> 00:00:14,118
...to static friction between the tire
and the road to zero.

6
00:00:14,288 --> 00:00:17,538
(Sheldon:)But not so deep as to introduce
a new source of friction."

7
00:00:21,796 --> 00:00:24,336
(DMV Lady:)Here's your learner's permit. Go away.

8
00:00:25,591 --> 00:00:29,091
(Sheldon:)But I'm not done. I have many
additional concerns about these questions.

9
00:00:29,261 --> 00:00:32,601
- Don't make me climb over this counter.
- All right, come on. Let's go.

10
00:00:34,225 --> 00:00:35,895
WOMAN:
Next.

11
00:00:36,060 --> 00:00:37,640
(Sheldon:)Aced it.

12
00:00:40,272 --> 00:00:44,152
(Howard:)Okay. That's it. Let's boot it up.

13
00:00:44,318 --> 00:00:45,568
(Leonard:)Booting.

14
00:00:46,320 --> 00:00:48,200
(Howard:)This is a state-of-the-art simulator.

15
00:00:48,364 --> 00:00:50,954
(Howard:)I adapted it from something
a friend designed for the Army.

16
00:00:51,116 --> 00:00:53,036
Is that why I appear to be in Fallujah...

17
00:00:53,202 --> 00:00:55,832
(Sheldon:)...behind the wheel
of an up-armored Humvee?

18
00:00:56,247 --> 00:00:59,027
(Howard:)I haven't configured it yet.

